[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7861.669, "timestamp": "02:11:01", "text": "呃，除此之外，我还需要……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7863.99, "timestamp": "02:11:03", "text": "停止增加过多的副业或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7867.83, "timestamp": "02:11:07", "text": "一个接一个，因为我觉得就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7869.51, "timestamp": "02:11:09", "text": "我有，所以我不治疗。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7871.75, "timestamp": "02:11:11", "text": "就像那些让人分心的东西一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7875.35, "timestamp": "02:11:15", "text": "逃避我主要任务的方法"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7879.55, "timestamp": "02:11:19", "text": "项目之类的。啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7881.35, "timestamp": "02:11:21", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7884.39, "timestamp": "02:11:24", "text": "直播情况如何？我看到你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7887.189, "timestamp": "02:11:27", "text": "研磨，对吧？那是漫画里的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7889.669, "timestamp": "02:11:29", "text": "或者，哦，不。那是我的艺术，仅此而已。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7891.83, "timestamp": "02:11:31", "text": "那个东西。那是我的副业。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7894.87, "timestamp": "02:11:34", "text": "并非如此，我只是又增加了一项待办事项。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7896.79, "timestamp": "02:11:36", "text": "我当时就想，真是见鬼了。就像我曾经那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7898.95, "timestamp": "02:11:38", "text": "想画一幅同人图"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7902.47, "timestamp": "02:11:42", "text": "每月一篇。就像，兄弟，你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7904.79, "timestamp": "02:11:44", "text": "漫画正在创作中。你仍然拥有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7908.709, "timestamp": "02:11:48", "text": "要画的漫画。我当时就想，真是见鬼了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7912.55, "timestamp": "02:11:52", "text": "是的，这是一辆车。但你每次都这样做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7916.31, "timestamp": "02:11:56", "text": "一个月是《海贼王》的月份。哇。嗯，是的。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7918.55, "timestamp": "02:11:58", "text": "不，这个更像是我想要的"}]